<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Rosuvastatin tablets are indicated: • To reduce the risk of major adverse cardiovascular (CV) events (CV death, nonfatal myocardial infarction, nonfatal stroke, or an arterial revascularization procedure) in adults at increased risk for CV events. • As an adjunct to diet and exercise to reduce low-density lipoprotein cholesterol (LDL-C): o in adults with hypercholesterolemia. o and slow the progression of atherosclerosis in adults. o in adults and pediatric patients aged ...</Data></Cell>
</Row>
