<Cell ss:StyleID="dataAlt"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE TZIELD is indicated to [see Dosage and Administration (2.1) ]: Delay the onset of Stage 3 type 1 diabetes (T1D) in adult and pediatric patients 1 year of age and older with Stage 2 T1D. Delay the decline in endogenous insulin production in pediatric patients aged 8 to 17 years recently diagnosed with Stage 3 T1D. This indication is approved under accelerated approval based on evidence of reduced C-peptide decline [see Clinical Studies (14.2) ] . Continued approval for thi...</Data></Cell>
