<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE AIRSUPRA is indicated for the as-needed treatment or prevention of bronchoconstriction and to reduce the risk of exacerbations in patients with asthma 18 years of age and older. AIRSUPRA is a combination of albuterol, a beta 2 -adrenergic agonist and budesonide, a corticosteroid, indicated for the as-needed treatment or prevention of bronchoconstriction and to reduce the risk of exacerbations in patients with asthma 18 years of age and older. ( 1 )</Data></Cell>
