<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE Isosorbide mononitrate extended-release tablets are indicated for the prevention of angina pectoris due to coronary artery disease. The onset of action of oral isosorbide mononitrate is not sufficiently rapid for this product to be useful in aborting an acute anginal episode.</Data></Cell>
</Row>
