<Cell ss:StyleID="data"><Data ss:Type="String">1 INDICATIONS AND USAGE Dalfampridine extended-release tablet is indicated as a treatment to improve walking in adult patients with multiple sclerosis (MS). This was demonstrated by an increase in walking speed [see Clinical Studies (14) ]. Dalfampridine extended-release tablet is a potassium channel blocker indicated to improve walking in adult patients with multiple sclerosis (MS). This was demonstrated by an increase in walking speed (1, 14) .</Data></Cell>
